  "title": "Leftover Spaghetti Lasagna",
  "description": "Get the flavor of lasagna with the easiest layered baked spaghetti dish ever. Just mix cooked thin spaghetti with prepared sauce, layer with cottage cheese, sprinkle with mozzarella cheese, and bake. It's a perfect way to use up left-over spaghetti.",
